  "description": "On-device LLM inference for Circle. Alibaba MNN P/Invoke layer with Qwen 3 chat generator. 1.3.0 adds ModelDownloadService.EnsureBundleAsync — the multi-file MNN bundle downloader that fetches every file MNN-LLM needs (config.json, llm.mnn, llm.mnn.weight, tokenizer.txt, llm_config.json, configuration.json) into a per-model directory with Primary→Fallback URL fallback per file, atomic temp→move, cache reuse via SHA verify, and per-file SHA-256 verification. MnnInferenceBridgeFactory now routes bundle entries through EnsureBundleAsync and points QwenTextGenerator at the bundle's config.json. IModelDownloadService gains EnsureBundleAsync(modelId, repo, bundleFiles, progress, ct) + BundleFileSpec record. 1.2.3 fixed the SHA-256 \"sha256:\" prefix-strip bug + set a realistic User-Agent.",
